{
 "file": "06BLK02A base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:8",
   "ptr": "0x8",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "『シノブさんへ。\\f",
   "en": "'Dear Shinobu-san,",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:1e",
   "ptr": "0x1e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　わたしはこれから、マッカロックの遺\\n",
   "en": "I am now setting out to survey the Maccaloc Ruins. With things so unsettled around us, I cannot stop worrying about the colleagues I am leaving behind.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:47",
   "ptr": "0x47",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  跡へ調査に向かいます。周囲の情勢が\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:1e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:70",
   "ptr": "0x70",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  不穏な今、この場に残していく同僚の\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:1e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:99",
   "ptr": "0x99",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  方々が心配でなりません。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:1e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:b9",
   "ptr": "0xb9",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　城は閉鎖され、兵士以外の者の立ち入\\n",
   "en": "The castle has been closed, and no one but soldiers is allowed inside.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:e2",
   "ptr": "0xe2",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  りが許されなくなりました。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:b9"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:104",
   "ptr": "0x104",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  また、街へ繰り出した兵士たちは、遺\\n",
   "en": "I also hear that soldiers sent out into the city are arresting people who oppose the ruins survey and locking them away somewhere.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:12d",
   "ptr": "0x12d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  跡調査に反対する人々を逮捕し、何処\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:104"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:156",
   "ptr": "0x156",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  かへ監禁してるとも聞きます。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:104"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:17a",
   "ptr": "0x17a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　これらの動きは、全て、シノブさんを\\n",
   "en": "All of this began the day I sent you to the castle, Shinobu-san. Where have you vanished to since then?",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:1a3",
   "ptr": "0x1a3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  城へ送り出した日から始まってます。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:17a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:1cc",
   "ptr": "0x1cc",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  あれ以来、シノブさんはどこへ消えて\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:17a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:1f5",
   "ptr": "0x1f5",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  しまったのですか？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:17a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:20f",
   "ptr": "0x20f",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　もしや、まだ城の中に？\\n",
   "en": "Could you still be inside the castle? Or else...",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:22c",
   "ptr": "0x22c",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　それとも・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　もしや、まだ城の中に？\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:20f"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:242",
   "ptr": "0x242",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　やはり、シノブさんをあれに会わせた\\n",
   "en": "Was it my having you meet that thing, Shinobu-san, that set off some disaster no one could foresee?",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:26b",
   "ptr": "0x26b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  のが原因で、何か予想もつかない凶事\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:242"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:294",
   "ptr": "0x294",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  を引き起こしてしまったのでしょうか？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:242"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:2c0",
   "ptr": "0x2c0",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そうだとしたら、責任はすべてわたし\\n",
   "en": "If so, the responsibility is mine alone.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:2e9",
   "ptr": "0x2e9",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  にあります。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:2c0"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:2fd",
   "ptr": "0x2fd",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　わたしの未熟な判断で、シノブさんを\\n",
   "en": "Shinobu-san, I apologize from the bottom of my heart for putting you in danger through my poor judgment. If I may be forgiven, I wish only to make amends.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:326",
   "ptr": "0x326",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  危険にさらしてしまったことを、心か\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:2fd"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:34f",
   "ptr": "0x34f",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  らおわびします。許されるならば、償\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:2fd"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:378",
   "ptr": "0x378",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  いをしたい気持ちで一杯です。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:2fd"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:39c",
   "ptr": "0x39c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　城の中の同僚には未だ連絡がとれませ\\n",
   "en": "I still cannot reach my colleagues in the castle. All I can do is pray that you are safe, Shinobu-san.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:3c5",
   "ptr": "0x3c5",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ん。わたしは、シノブさんが無事であ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:39c"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:3ee",
   "ptr": "0x3ee",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "  るのを願うばかりです。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:39c"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:40c",
   "ptr": "0x40c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  そしてもしも、シノブさんが元気な姿\\n",
   "en": "And if you, Shinobu-san, should come back to this library again, safe and sound...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:435",
   "ptr": "0x435",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  で再びこの図書館を訪れたならば。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:40c"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:45d",
   "ptr": "0x45d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　どうか、この手紙に気づいてくださる\\n",
   "en": "I pray to the earth spirits that you will find this letter... Riel Redellin'",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:486",
   "ptr": "0x486",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  よう・・・大地の精霊に祈りを込めて。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:45d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:4b1",
   "ptr": "0x4b1",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　　　　　　  　リール・レッドエリン』\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:45d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:4e2",
   "ptr": "0x4e2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　手紙の下に、バルクルーサ発行の通行\\n",
   "en": "Beneath the letter was a Pass issued by Balkrutha.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:50b",
   "ptr": "0x50b",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  証があった。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02A:4e2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:51e",
   "ptr": "0x51e",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　手持ちの通行証と交換しますか？",
   "en": "Exchange it for the Pass you have?",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  証があった。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:552",
   "ptr": "0x552",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "新しい通行証を手に入れた。\\f",
   "en": "Obtained the new Pass.",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02A:578",
   "ptr": "0x578",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　考え直した。\\f",
   "en": "Decided against it.",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
 ]
}
